[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SRS024
TITLE: Train a towered airport from airline and general-aviation demand
STATEMENT: >>>
The Tower CSCI shall build airline and general-aviation demand for a towered airport, run that demand as a shard of one airport, a region, or a national set, record and replay the decisions, accept instructor injects for emergency, NORDO, vehicle, deviation, and weather, and score separation losses, incursions, deferred clearances, and radio time. Acceptance is a replay that matches the record and a score that counts one deferred clearance.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A national training run is many airports of the same software, scored after the fact, not a live facility feed.
<<<
DAL: C
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: Tests use fixtures and do not require a live download. One machine is not required to fly every busy tower in realtime. Bulk historical tracks stay out of the repository. This is not a certification claim and not a live NAS connection.
